        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CAHH3, Coat and Hat Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid brass, this wall hook features double hook arms for hanging both your coat and hat. Also used in bathrooms for hanging belts, robes, coats or towels. It can mounted to your wall or the inside of closet doors. Easy to install with the included mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"299\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-CAHH3-size.gif?v=1704354767\" width=\"299\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana CAHH3 Coat and Hat Hook Size\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana CAHH3 Coat and Hat Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Top Hook Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bottom Hook Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAHH3.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana CAHH3 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
